This software is used for interacting with the hardware random data generator devices AlphaRNG and AlphaRNG PQ for the purpose of downloading true random bytes.

This software requires `OpenSSL` library when communicating with the AlphaRNG device.

This software uses `OpenSSL` (directly or indirectly) which is distributed under the terms of the Apache License V2. For more information, please visit: https://www.openssl.org/source/apache-license-2.0.txt

This software includes `mlkem-native` (ML-KEM-1024 key encapsulation for AlphaRNG PQ devices), which is used under the terms of the MIT License. Its source code and license are located in the `mlkem` directories of the API source code.

The copyright notices and license terms of the third-party software are reproduced in the THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt file, which must be included with any distribution of this software in source or binary form.

This software may only be used in conjunction with an AlphaRNG or AlphaRNG PQ device.
